sequenceDiagram
    actor Candidate
    actor Recruiter
    actor Admin
    participant RMS
    participant DB

    Candidate->>RMS: Raise Dispute
    RMS->>DB: Store Dispute

    Admin->>RMS: View Dispute
    RMS->>DB: Fetch Details
    DB-->>Admin: Dispute Information

    Admin->>Candidate: Request Evidence
    Candidate-->>Admin: Submit Evidence

    Admin->>Recruiter: Request Response
    Recruiter-->>Admin: Submit Response

    Admin->>RMS: Resolve Dispute
    RMS->>DB: Update Status

    alt Refund Required
        RMS->>Candidate: Refund Payment
    else Release Payment
        RMS->>Recruiter: Close Dispute
    end